// Committed, CI-safe signing config. This file MUST exist for xcodegen
// (configFiles paths are validated at generate time), so it is checked in.
//
// It optionally pulls in a developer-private override, `Signing.local.xcconfig`
// (git-ignored), which sets DEVELOPMENT_TEAM to a stable Apple Development team
// identity. That keeps the macOS Keychain access-control owner consistent
// across rebuilds, so the app stops re-prompting for your login/keychain
// password on every launch. Without the override the build falls back to the
// project's default ($(DEVELOPMENT_TEAM) / ad-hoc), exactly as before — so CI
// and contributors without the file are unaffected.
//
// To enable locally:
//   cp Signing.local.xcconfig.template Signing.local.xcconfig
//   # then set DEVELOPMENT_TEAM to your team id
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
